    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just a ghost haunting my own skin lately. everything i was... the grace, the movement, the way i felt like i actually belonged in the world... it's just gone. it's like my body betrayed me and left me behind in this shell that doesnt even feel like mine anymore. i dont even recognize the person in the mirror.",
